    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the World of Drakefall in this roguelike deckbuilder. Build your deck, discover powerful items, and journey through swamps and mountain peaks with a familiar playstyle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tell us what do you think about Drakefall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/e9930edd049843896e4c843a25a53621.poster.avif?t=1750932474\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/e9930edd049843896e4c843a25a53621.webm?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/e9930edd049843896e4c843a25a53621.mp4?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild What Was Broken: The Worldframe -</strong> Make strategic card choices! Explore and acquire hundreds of cards to build your deck with every attempt to conquer the ruptured world of Drakefall. Pick cards that synergize well to effectively defeat foes and challenge the ruling dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/fbb53853b46f9f8966020e00107bbb7e.poster.avif?t=1750932474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/fbb53853b46f9f8966020e00107bbb7e.webm?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/fbb53853b46f9f8966020e00107bbb7e.mp4?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Deck Construction</strong>: Make strategic card choices! Explore and acquire hundreds of cards to build your deck with every attempt to conquer the ruptured world of Drakefall. Pick cards that synergize well to effectively defeat foes and challenge the dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/378c8e6bd61095931ed7dd35caab1491.poster.avif?t=1750932474\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/378c8e6bd61095931ed7dd35caab1491.webm?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/378c8e6bd61095931ed7dd35caab1491.mp4?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic World</strong>: Each journey through the fractured realm of Drakefall is unique. Opt for perilous or secure paths, encounter diverse enemies, select varied cards, uncover distinct relics, and face different challenges every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/d16e5bec6dd71c93425d3cd452b9139c.poster.avif?t=1750932474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/d16e5bec6dd71c93425d3cd452b9139c.webm?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/d16e5bec6dd71c93425d3cd452b9139c.mp4?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the Power of the Stars:</strong> Engage in the mystical art of <strong>Starbinding</strong>, where you channel the celestial energies to gain powerful bonuses. As you ascend the floors, the potency of these bonuses increases, offering strategic advantages. Choose the right moment to claim your active bonus and shape your journey through the world of Drakefall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/5bdf578088e24443356ce63a5daa85d4.poster.avif?t=1750932474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/5bdf578088e24443356ce63a5daa85d4.webm?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/5bdf578088e24443356ce63a5daa85d4.mp4?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse World</strong>: Traverse diverse biomes, each offering unique challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/dec8e0ed68f4b8a3c13853f08c22f286.poster.avif?t=1750932474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/dec8e0ed68f4b8a3c13853f08c22f286.webm?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143810/extras/dec8e0ed68f4b8a3c13853f08c22f286.mp4?t=1750932474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
